  "summary": "WILMINGTON, Del., June 03, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NRx Pharmaceuticals, Inc. (Nasdaq: NRXP) (“NRx Pharmaceuticals” or the “Company”), a clinical-stage biopharmaceutical company, today announced the pricing of an underwritten public offering (the “Offering”) of 5,714,286 shares of its common stock,",
